## 🔗 Relationships Between Nodes

| Node | Points to |
|------|-----------|
| `profiles/${uid}` | Avatar, name, mood → used in `userChats` fallback. |
| `userChats/${uid}/${partnerId}` | References `profiles/${partnerId}` for name/avatar. |
