#### **4. Search Cache (`echo_cache_v2_search_{query}`)**

```json
{
  "data": [
    {
      "id": "uid_1",
      "name": "John Doe",
      "country": "Nigeria",
      "city": "Lagos",
      "interests": ["coding"],
      "isOnline": true
    }
  ],
  "expiry": 1786542179011,
  "version": "v2"
